/v1/","context":{"app_id":3453430,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-3453430","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:54:31Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=3639980","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3453430-1846651706691256","game_id":"steam-3453430","kind":"announcement","title":"Rush Your Band Demo on STEAM NEXT FEST","summary":"Welcome to Rush Your Band!Watch the gameplay of our chaotic co-op music simulator where you can record your real voice!What you can do:Record tracks: Use your mic to drop bars and make music with friends.Manage your band: Start from the bottom and build your dream studio.Pure co-op chaos: Have fun, fix instruments, and create viral memes. DO THIS RIGHT NOW:Download the FREE Demo on this page and try it with your friends!ADD TO WISHLIST -> to support a solo developer! It helps a lot!Grab your mic","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:55:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691256","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3453430-1844115010491965","game_id":"steam-3453430","kind":"announcement","title":"Rush Your Band Demo — Co-op Issues, Actively Working On It","summary":"Hey! Wanted to give a heads up on where things stand.Co-op might be a bit rough right now — running into some issues there and I know it. I'm deep in fixing it, so bear with me for a bit.On the plus side: most other bugs are squashed, and the recording system specifically got a proper fix. Also chipping away at optimization on the side.Appreciate the patience, more updates soon!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T13:01:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010491965","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3453430-1844115010488819","game_id":"steam-3453430","kind":"announcement","title":"Rush Your Band Demo — Bugs Squashed, Recording Fixed","summary":"Hey! Quick update on how things are going.Fixed most of the bugs that piled up over the last while. Spent a good chunk of time digging into the recording system specifically — there was an issue where the audio could start looping on itself mid-take. That's sorted now, recording works the way it should.Still working on: optimization (grinding on it) and co-op — I want to get it into a proper state, it's not as smooth as I'd like yet.Also, female characters for customization might be coming soon ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T11:22:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010488819","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3453430-1843481262698602","game_id":"steam-3453430","kind":"update","title":"Rush Your Band Demo — Update: Major Bugs Fixed","summary":"Hey everyone,Quick follow-up on the earlier note — most of the game-breaking bugs have now been fixed.Sorry again for the rough launch. Thanks for sticking around.Let me know if you run into anything else.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T01:07:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262698602","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3453430-1843481262697335","game_id":"steam-3453430","kind":"announcement","title":"Rush Your Band Demo — Quick Note","summary":"Hey everyone, Thanks for trying the demo. I know there are some bugs in there right now — sorry about that. This is a solo project and things slipped through before launch.I'm on it and fixing things as fast as I can. Appreciate you sticking with it in the meantime.More soon.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T11:46:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262697335","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3453430-1843481262692191","game_id":"steam-3453430","kind":"announcement","title":"Rush Your Band — Demo drops tomorrow","summary":"Hey everyone,Tomorrow the demo goes live, and I wanted to share a bit of why this game exists before that happens.I've been connected to music since I was a kid — never as a real artist, more as someone who always loved it from the side. At some point I realized I'd probably never actually live that experience myself: stepping up to a mic, dropping a track, watching people react to something you made. So I decided to build a game where anyone could feel a piece of that.For the past 9 months, I'v","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T13:18:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262692191","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3453430":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:40:37Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:40:37Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3453430":"2026-10-26T00:40:37Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3453430":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:40:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-